<title>RWANDA: GOVERNMENT LIST.</title>
<headline>GOVERNMENT LIST.</headline>
<text>
<p>RWANDA GOVERNMENT LIST (970404)</p>
<p> President (Sworn in 19 Jul 94)..Pasteur BIZIMUNGU (RPF, HUTU)</p>
<p> Vice-President...............Maj-Gen Paul KAGAME (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p>(Also Minister of Defence)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>NATIONAL UNITY GOVERNMENT:</p>
<p> (For party affiliations see end of list)</p>
<p> Prime Minister............Pierre Celestin RWIGEMA (MDR, HUTU)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>MINISTERS:</p>
<p> Agriculture, Livestock, Environment</p>
<p>     &amp; Rural Development.......Augustin IYAMUREMYE (PSD, HUTU)</p>
<p> Commerce, Industry and Cooperatives......Bonaventure NIYIBIZI</p>
<p> Communications...............Charles NTAKIRUTINKA (PSD, HUTU)</p>
<p> Defence....................................See Vice-President</p>
<p> Education.....................Dr Joseph KAREMERA (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p> Finance &amp; Economic</p>
<p>     Planning........Jean Berchmans BIRARA (Independent, HUTU)</p>
<p> Foreign Affairs &amp; Cooperation.....Anastase GASANA (MDR, HUTU)</p>
<p> Gender, Family &amp; Social Affairs..Aloysia INYUMBA (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p> Handicraft, Mining &amp; Tourism........Marc RUGENERA (PSD, HUTU)</p>
<p> Health.............................Vincent BIRUTA (PSD, HUTU)</p>
<p> Information............Jean Nepomuscene NAYINZIRA (PDC, HUTU)</p>
<p> Internal Affairs, Communal Development and</p>
<p>     Resettlement....Sheikh Abdulkarim HARELIMANA (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p> Justice......................Faustin NTEZILYAYO (INDEPENDENT)</p>
<p> Presidency.....................Patrick MAZIMHAKA (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p> Public Service &amp; Labour......Dr Joseph NSENGIMANA (PL, TUTSI)</p>
<p> Public Works...................Laurien NGIRABANZI (MDR, HUTU)</p>
<p> Youth, Sports &amp; Vocational</p>
<p>     Training...............Dr Jacques BIHOZAGARA (RPF, TUTSI)</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p>PARTY AFFILIATIONS:</p>
<p> RP  -- Rwanda Patriotic Front</p>
<p> PSD -- Social Democratic Party</p>
<p> MDR -- Republican Democratic Movement</p>
<p> PDC -- Christian Democratic Party</p>
<p> PL  -- Liberal Party</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
<p> Central Bank Governor.....Francois MUTEMBEREZE</p>
<p>				 - - - - - - -</p>
